WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.944
A moving average uses a sliding frame rather than an
ever-growing frame With

00:00:05.957 --> 00:00:10.852
two preceding rows and the current row the
calculation uses up to three ordered rows

00:00:12.591 --> 00:00:18.440
At the beginning of the sequence fewer than three
rows may be available The

00:00:18.467 --> 00:00:20.862
frame moves forward with the current row
